{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"type":"text","text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan"},{"text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, ","type":"text"},{"code":"tracking-plan.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tools outside the app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"},{"type":"text","text":" names"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","isActive":true},{"text":", marked ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"text":". It writes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanTesting"},{"text":". The schemas usually come from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module is a product of its own that "},{"code":"import Traffluent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" leaves out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan(schemas: [SignedUp.schema])","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Making-a-plan","title":"Making a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"]},{"anchor":"Writing-a-plan","title":"Writing a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"]},{"anchor":"Checking-a-plan","title":"Checking a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"TrackingPlans","modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"externalID":"TrackingPlans","symbolKind":"module"},"references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCommand":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"TrackingPlanCommand","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An executable that writes a tracking plan: the type marked ","type":"text"},{"code":"@main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in a target of the app’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package that lists its events.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancommand"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCheck":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancheck","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What checking a tracking plan against the committed one found: a match, a committed plan that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is only out of date, or differences that break it."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"TrackingPlanCheck","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) of every event an app tracks: one document per event and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index, exported from the events’ "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlan"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlan"}],"title":"TrackingPlan","type":"topic"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/schemas":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/schemas","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"schemas","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventSchemaV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"title":"schemas","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The plan’s event schemas, ordered by the UTF-8 bytes of their names and then by version.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/schemas"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/files":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/files","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The plan’s files: the index, ","type":"text"},{"code":"tracking-plan.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then each event’s document and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, in the order